Here are my findings for the class `CExcel` and its method `ImportFromExcel`:

---

## 1. Class `CExcel` — NOT in source code

The class `CExcel` is **not defined as source code anywhere** in this project. It is a compiled external dependency:

**Project reference** (from `g:\0.CMS-MAIN-ALL\hue\wform\InformationWeb.csproj`, line 76-78):

```xml
<Reference Include="Libs, Version=1.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, processorArchitecture=x86">
  <HintPath>..\bin\Libs.dll</HintPath>
</Reference>
```

The `Libs` namespace and the `CExcel` class live inside `Libs.dll` — a pre-compiled library. No source code for `Libs.dll` exists anywhere under `g:\0.CMS-MAIN-ALL\hue`.

---

## 2. Method signature deduced from call sites

The `ImportFromExcel` static method is called at exactly **two places** with identical signatures:

**File:** `g:\0.CMS-MAIN-ALL\hue\wform\Controls\Sims\SubjectMarkEdit.ascx.cs` (line 1207)

**File:** `g:\0.CMS-MAIN-ALL\hue\wform\Controls\Sims\ExamMarkEdit.ascx.cs` (line 639)

The call is:

```csharp
intDoneCount = Libs.CExcel.ImportFromExcel(strPhysicalPath, "StudentCode", hstColumns, hstReplaceValues, dtb);
```

From these call sites, the method signature is:

```csharp
public static int ImportFromExcel(
    string physicalPath,      // Full physical path to the .xls/.xlsx file on server
    string keyColumn,         // Column name used as the key for matching rows ("StudentCode")
    Hashtable columnMapping,  // Maps Excel column headers → DataTable column names
    Hashtable replaceValues,  // Maps old (text) values → new (numeric) values for replacement
    DataTable targetDataTable // The DataTable to populate with imported data
);
```

- **Returns:** `int` — the number of rows successfully processed/updated.
- **Key column:** `"StudentCode"` — used to match Excel rows to existing DataTable rows (lookup key).

---

## 3. Full local `ImportFromExcel` methods (the callers)

Since `CExcel.ImportFromExcel` is in a DLL, the closest thing to "full implementation" is how the callers build the arguments. Here are **both** local wrappers:

### Caller 1 — SubjectMarkEdit.ascx.cs (lines 1153–1213)

**Full path:** `g:\0.CMS-MAIN-ALL\hue\wform\Controls\Sims\SubjectMarkEdit.ascx.cs`

```csharp
private void ImportFromExcel(String strPhysicalPath)
{
    if (this.dtbData == null)
        return;

    DataTable dtb = this.dtbData.Copy(); // lấy viewstate ra

    Hashtable hstColumns = new Hashtable();
    Hashtable hstReplaceValues = new Hashtable();

    hstColumns.Add("Description", "Description");

    // 2 cột điểm quá trình (nếu cho phép edit)
    if (Convert.ToBoolean(hidAllowEditMark.Value))
    {
        for (int i = 1; i < 8; i++)
        {
            hstColumns.Add("Mark1" + i.ToString(), "Mark1" + i.ToString());
            hstColumns.Add("Mark2" + i.ToString(), "Mark2" + i.ToString());
        }
    }

    string[] cols = { "Exam", "TheoryExam", "PracticeExam" };

    // Thi lần 1 (nếu có cho phép)
    if (Convert.ToBoolean(hidAllowEditExam1.Value))
    {
        foreach (string str in cols)
            hstColumns.Add(str + 1, str + 1);
    }

    // Thi lần 2 (nếu chưa khóa toàn sổ)
    if (Convert.ToBoolean(hidAllowEditExam2.Value))
    {
        foreach (string str in cols)
            hstColumns.Add(str + 2, str + 2);
    }

    // Nếu là điểm chữ
    if (Convert.ToBoolean(hidIsTextMark.Value))
    {
        hstReplaceValues.Add("Đ", 1); // điểm chữ đạt
        hstReplaceValues.Add("D", 1); // điểm chữ đạt

        hstReplaceValues.Add("KĐ", 0); // điểm chữ không đạt
        hstReplaceValues.Add("KD", 0); // điểm chữ không đạt
        hstReplaceValues.Add("K", 0); // điểm chữ không đạt
    }

    int intDoneCount = 0;
    try
    {
        intDoneCount = Libs.CExcel.ImportFromExcel(strPhysicalPath, "StudentCode", hstColumns, hstReplaceValues, dtb);
    }
    catch (Exception objExc)
    {
        ShowMsg("Tập tin không đúng mẫu nhập liệu!" + objExc.Message);
        return;
    }

    if (intDoneCount > 0)
    {
        string[] fieldExams = { "TheoryExam", "PracticeExam", "Exam" };

        foreach (DataRow drw in dtb.Rows)
        {
            if (drw["IsEdit"].ToString() == "1")
            {
                if (drw["StudentID"].ToString() == "")
                {
                    ShowMsg("Mã SV " + drw["StudentCode"].ToString() + " không tồn tại trong sổ điểm này!");
                    return;
                }

                #region Điểm hệ số 1,2
                for (int a = 1; a <= 2; a++)
                {
                    for (int b = 1; b <= 6; b++)
                    {
                        if (!IsValidMark(drw["Mark" + a + b]))
                        {
                            ShowMsg("Hệ số " + a + b + " của mã SV " + drw["StudentCode"].ToString() + " không hợp lệ!");
                            return;
                        }
                    }
                }
                #endregion

                // ... continues with exam validation and score calculation ...
            }
        }
    }
}
```

